# InputAtlas 仓库忽略规则
# 仅忽略可重新生成的构建产物、本地工具状态、运行数据和敏感文件。
# 源码、测试、安装器脚本、锁文件、许可证及应用 Assets 不应被忽略。

# .NET / MSBuild 构建缓存与输出
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/
**/[Dd]ebug/
**/[Rr]elease/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.dbg
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.runtimeconfig.dev.json
*.cache
*.binlog
*.buildlog
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.FileListAbsolute.txt

# NuGet 本地缓存与打包结果；packages.lock.json 必须保留
**/packages/
**/.nuget/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

# 项目发布、安装包和压缩制品
/artifacts/
**/installer/Output/
*.msi
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.sha256

# 测试、覆盖率与基准测试输出
**/TestResults/
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
**/coverage/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
test-results*.xml

# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code / 其他 IDE 本地状态
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.fleet/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.csproj.user
*.vbproj.user
*.fsproj.user
*.DotSettings.user
*.rsuser

# Codex / 智能体在仓库内产生的运行缓存与临时状态
**/.codex/
**/.codex-cache/
**/.codex-runtime/
**/.codex-tmp/
**/.codex-temp/
**/.codex-worktrees/
**/.agents/

# InputAtlas 本地运行数据、数据库、日志、备份和导出
**/Data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.log
*.dmp
*.mdmp
*.stackdump

# 本机配置、环境变量和签名私钥
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
*.key
*.pem

# 临时文件、编辑器备份和操作系统元数据
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.old
*.orig
*.rej
*~
~$*
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
System Volume Information/
